The product page header and the Reviews tab now describe the same reviews the page already loads. After a successful post, both update in place and the list stays at 5 reviews per page.

With reviews, the header shows the star rating, the average to one decimal place (for example `4.3`), and `1 review` or `N reviews`. The Reviews tab title uses that same count. With none, the header and the Reviews tab both show "No reviews yet", with no stars and no zero-count text. A review with no first or last name shows "Anonymous" and its stars. A named review still shows the name, stars, text, and how long ago it was posted. A refused post still shows the existing message and leaves the form as it is.

